<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Bank says to complete bad loan write-off.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Bank says to complete bad loan write-off.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Bank Ltd expects to complete writing off its bad loans by the end of March 1998, a senior bank official told a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>The official said its bad loans to non-bank financial institutions totalled 67.1 billion yen at the end of September this year, compared with 39.8 billion yen at the end of March this year.</p>
</text>
